# Field notes — describe corporate estates, never committed.
#
# ⚠️ NO trailing slash, deliberately. The notes live outside the checkout and `docs` is a
# local symlink to them. `docs/` matches a DIRECTORY only, and a symlink is a file to git —
# so the old pattern stopped ignoring it and the link (an absolute path) was staged for
# commit. `docs` matches either shape. Do not put the slash back.
docs
